{"title":"The Dune Bible","link":"https://kottke.org/25/01/the-dune-bible","date":1736359616000,"content":"\n        <p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/dune-bible-01.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/dune-bible-01.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/dune-bible-01.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1300\" height=\"945\" alt=\"cover of The Dune Bible\" /></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/dune-bible-02.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/dune-bible-02.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/dune-bible-02.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1300\" height=\"1005\" alt=\"drawing of a large vehicle from Dune\" /></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/dune-bible-03.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/dune-bible-03.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/dune-bible-03.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1300\" height=\"1011\" alt=\"drawing of a motorcycle-like vehicle from Dune\" /></p>\n\n<p>Recently sold at auction for £277,200, <a href=\"https://onlineonly.christies.com/s/science-fiction-fantasy/dune-bible-10/239955\">The Dune Bible</a> is the storyboard for Alejandro Jodorowsky’s film adaptation of Frank Herbert’s Dune, which was <a href=\"https://www.jodorowskysdune.com/\">famously never made</a>. From <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/DDRxHp7u_sZ/\">an Instagram tour of the book</a>:</p>\n\n<blockquote><p>The book contains a complete storyboard that tells the narrative of the proposed Dune film shot by shot, in addition to depictions of all the featured characters, vehicles, and environments by the greatest sci-fi artists of the time.</p></blockquote>\n\n<p>The auction house believes that only 20 of these bibles were ever made and only 10 have survived. An imperfect scan of the book appears to be <a href=\"https://archive.org/details/jododrowskys-dune-alexandro-jodorowsky-z-library/mode/2up\">available on The Internet Archive</a> and <a href=\"https://archive.org/details/jodorowsky-dune\">here’s a sample of around 46 images</a>.</p>\n\n<p>A similar copy of the book was sold for <em>$3 million</em> in 2021 <a href=\"https://www.theartnewspaper.com/2022/01/17/nft-group-shamed-jodorowsky-dune-book-copyright\">to a bunch of crypto-dopes</a> who “believed that the purchase granted them the copyright to the book, which they intended to splice and sell as NFTs before burning the physical copy”.</p>\n\n        \n\n         <p><strong>Tags:</strong> <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/Alejandro%20Jodorowsky\">Alejandro Jodorowsky</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/books\">books</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/Dune\">Dune</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/movies\">movies</a></p>\n\n         <p>💬 <a href=\"https://kottke.org/25/01/the-dune-bible\">Join the discussion on kottke.org</a> →</p>\n\n    ","author":"Jason Kottke","siteTitle":"Kottke","siteHash":"89a883271b4598f9b33ebe87be70d38557bcd266e68aee521a8f93622e0ab723","entryHash":"06d6611da581e119f44e5c76a080a4d8aa24d4a74ed3b2948e3f2c60edc838ef","category":"Sites"}